WEBVTT

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:08.630
Must be my lucky day... Never thought
I'd find a babe like you in a slum like this.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:14.710
You must be doing quite well for yourself
to be able to reserve an entire inn.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.210
Sure am. An exclusive Quest fell into my lap, see...

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.170
A Quest?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.380
It was an odd one.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.040
Had to go down to the 30th Level,
collect some weird item, and bring it back.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.920
Is that so...?

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.960
And so...

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:27.540
...the Prince and Princess were wed,
and they lived happily ever after.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.540
I hope that one day you meet someone
charming of your own.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:47.420
Someday, I hope you find your own true hero...

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:19.420
I need to apologize.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.130
Miss Ais!

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:25.750
Lefiya?

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.170
Oh no, I just...

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.960
I'm sorry for interrupting your training.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:32.580
No. It's all right.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.580
You sure like to start swinging your sword
bright and early, don't you, Miss Ais?

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:38.790
Oof...

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.500
Are you studying your magic, Lefiya?

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:50.040
Yes! Miss Riveria is teaching me all kinds of things,
even Concurrent Chanting!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.420
Lefiya!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.040
What are you doing down there?

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.540
How long does it take to go and grab a book?!

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:01.580
I'm sorry! I have to go now, Miss Ais!

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.330
She's repaired, good as new.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.170
But...

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.250
How you managed to destroy this one in five days...

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.880
They should call you Blacksmith's Bane.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.330
I'm... sorry.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.880
Um, the cost...

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:31.000
40 million valis.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.420
Ais!

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.670
Got any plans today?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.710
I thought I might... hole up in the Dungeon.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.290
All by yourself?

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.630
I need to earn some money...

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.580
Oh! Then I'll go with you!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.540
I need some cash to pay for the Urga
I had to get re-forged!

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:59.170
I-in that case, can I come along too?

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:02.420
Wait, did you break somethin' too, Lefiya?

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.460
N-no...

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.000
You see...

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.790
I just wanted to help Miss Ais.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.040
Are you sure?

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:12.830
Of course!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.250
Let's all go then!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.580
You'll come too, right, Tione?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:17.790
I'll pass.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:18.460
What?
I'll pass.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.880
I don't want to leave the Boss' side.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.790
Finn, Riveria!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:28.170
We're about to head to the Dungeon. Wanna come with?

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:32.710
A bit of a carefree stroll, huh?

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:35.080
Sure, I'll accompany you.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:40.830
Me too! I was JUST thinking
of heading out as well, Boss!

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:45.170
Exploring in a small group is nice every once in a while.

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:46.130
Boss!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.960
Huh? You the only one here, Bete?

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.790
Where're Ais and the gang?

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.380
The Dungeon, apparently.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.580
How sad! They left poor Wolfy behind?

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.750
Like hell they did!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.960
I'm here 'cuz I wanna be!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:11.630
They can beg all they want, it ain't gonna happen!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:17.580
Uh-huh... In that case, wouldja be my escort for the day?

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.250
Huh?

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:32.250
I thought this'd be Urga II's first taste of battle,
but these guys are kinda pathetic...

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.960
Can't expect much from this Level.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:38.130
Wanna keep goin' straight to the 19th Level?

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:40.420
No, let's rest up a bit first.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.630
We can exchange these dropped items while we're at it.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.790
What about lodging?

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.080
Are we gonna camp out in the woods like always?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:56.000
We've barely got enough equipment
to set up camp at all.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.500
Why don't we stay at the inn for a change?

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:07.880
But Boss, staying here in Rivira
is sure to cost us a fortune.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.630
It's fine. This time it's on me.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.540
Woohoo! You're so generous, Finn!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.420
Riveria?

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:20.630
Odd. The town feels off somehow.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.750
Now that you mention it, the streets seem so empty...

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.670
Gods dammit! I won't tolerate this!

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:30.750
Bors!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.000
The Loki Familia?

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.000
Damn, and at a time like this...

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.790
Did something happen, Bors?

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.750
There's been a murder. At Willy's Inn.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.420
I'm not askin' you folk to get involved in all this.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:56.170
We intend to stay at an inn here.
You can't pretend this has nothing to do with us.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.500
Tch!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.290
Any suspects?

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.880
The woman this guy was with last night, most likely.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:14.080
But she was already gone by the time
Willy here got back this mornin'.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.670
What did the woman look like?

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:20.170
I don't have the slightest clue.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.790
She was covering her face with a hood...

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:28.290
And this guy was covered head to toe in plate armor,
so I couldn't even tell what Familia he was from.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:33.420
You're not sure of his identity, then.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:38.000
Right. As you can see, he got bashed up so bad
ya can't even tell who he is no more.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.750
So... that's why I went and got this.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:44.710
Status Thief.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:49.330
So you're going to pick the lock
on his Status and force it to appear.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:53.830
Desecrating a corpse isn't something
that should be praised...

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.750
Now ain't the time for that kinda talk.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:02.750
High Elf, you can read this, can't you?

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:07.080
He belonged to the Ganesha Familia.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.380
His name... Hashana Dorlia.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.210
Lv.4...

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:12.540
You gotta be kiddin' me!

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:16.290
A Lv.4 Adventurer just got slaughtered
like some helpless animal?!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.330
You coulda mentioned
we'd be trudgin' through the sewers.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.000
There's somethin' I wanna check out, see...

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.960
Does it have to do with all that ruckus at Monsterphilia?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:32.750
Sure does...

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:38.290
I've been doin' a little pokin' around of my own.
All that's left is this place.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:39.330
Huh?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.130
Looks like this gate's been opened recently.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:46.290
Bete!

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:47.170
Cheh...

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:56.290
Cheh! The whole area's flooded.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:00.880
What do you w-

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.170
Hey, Bete! Gimme a piggyback ride!

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:07.290
HUH?!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:11.170
I don't wanna get my shoesies wet!
So come on, gimme a ride!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:14.500
Hell no! It ain't even that deep. Now walk!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.670
No way! I want a piggyback!
Carry me, carry me, carry me!

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.380
I'm not movin' unless you gimme a piggyback ride!

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.500
Woohoo!

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:27.080
Poor Wolfy, too bad it had to be ME up here, huh?

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:27.580
What?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:31.790
I bet you'd rather give Aisy-poo a piggyback ride! Right?!

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:34.000
Shut your mouth before I drop you!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.330
Don't!

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:39.750
I'm pickin' up somethin'.

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:46.710
Smells like people. It's faint,
but somebody was definitely in here recently.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.580
Can't deny that somethin's goin' on in here.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:54.880
Loki, get off.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:13.960
This some kinda cistern?

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.290
Get back, Loki.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:29.750
Looks like we hit the jackpot.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:37.040
The suspect is a woman...

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:40.420
...and capable of killing a Lv.4. Adventurer.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.540
It all adds up!

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:50.960
You folk showed up, actin' like you just got here,
but who's to say it wasn't one o' you?!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:54.670
Y-yeah! They coulda seduced him,
and when his guard was down...!

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:55.710
Was it you?

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:56.630
You?

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:57.670
You?

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.080
YOU?!

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.130
Nah... Couldn't be that one.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.380
Nope. Definitely not.

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.170
The hell makes you say that?!

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.170
Yeah! Lil' suspicious, huh...?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:18.250
Uh-huh, a rack like that, any guy would...
Who could resist... the temptation...

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:23.290
I'M SAVING MYSELF FOR THE BOSS!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:28.250
No joke... Mess with me and I'll rip that bit of filth
dangling between your legs right off!

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:31.630
Uh, Bors...

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:36.830
As you can see, none of these women
have the skills necessary to seduce the opposite sex.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:42.380
Still... I wonder what the killer's motive was.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.830
Hmm...

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:47.670
Her method WAS a bit extreme for simple burglary.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:52.830
Judging by the state of his belongings,
she was searching for something.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:59.170
You sayin' she lost her temper and went crazy
when she couldn't find what she wanted?

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.710
Supposing that was true...

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.290
Then the killer would still be in this town.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:10.880
If you wanted something so badly you'd kill for it,
would you give up so easily?

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.830
Just a hunch.

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.080
One more to go!

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:34.000
Screw it!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.170
There we go!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.460
Burn in Hell!

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:08.710
Hell of a show, there!

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.750
Can't believe I had to use a Magic Weapon...

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:17.460
We may have found SOMETHIN',
but nothin' that points to who's pullin' the strings.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.540
This is...

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.290
It had the same kinda Magic Stone?

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:31.880
Yeah. Tione got her hands on one of 'em.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:35.250
From that weird new species we ran into
on the 50th Level.

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:39.790
You know, they were kinda similar
to the things we just fought back there.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.750
What's wrong, Bete?

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.330
Huh? Oh!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.540
Hey, it's Dionysus!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:51.540
Fancy runnin' into you here of-

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:52.420
Hold it!

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.830
That scent lingering in the sewers was theirs.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.920
The killer is a woman capable of
murderin' a Lv.4 Adventurer!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:07.880
But...!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:12.460
Who knows what sorta powerful men
can fall victim to a woman's weapons!

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.630
Which is why...

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:18.330
All the girls are gettin' a full body inspection! Clothes off!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:23.960
Don't be ridiculous.

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.080
We'll be the ones to inspect the women.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.460
Okay everyone, please line up...

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.540
Finn! Hurry and inspect me!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.420
Come on, pleeease?

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.790
Every inch of my body, 'kay?

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:36.500
These... Damn...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.630
SHAMELESS WHORES!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.170
They've knocked Finn to the ground!

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.130
If you must, take me instead!

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.210
No, no, me!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.830
Um...

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.790
I don't know what's what anymore.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:54.040
That girl...

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:55.880
Miss Ais!

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.420
First of all, I'd like to clear up a misunderstanding.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:14.130
I had nothing to do with the incident
that occurred at Monsterphilia.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.750
Please believe me.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.500
Hah! Don't play with me!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:22.670
We said we found yer scent in that sewer
where the monsters were hidin'!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.210
I'll admit I did go to that sewer.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:30.250
In truth, I, too was investigating the monsters there.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.460
Why?

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.500
A month ago...

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:39.750
three members of my Familia were murdered.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.210
Judging by the crime scene,

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:47.790
it seems my children were taken out because
they saw something they weren't supposed to.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.670
The only clue they left behind was this.

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:54.420
A Magic Stone?

00:16:54.420 --> 00:17:00.580
And I collected THIS Stone from one of the monsters
slain by the Sword Princess at Monsterphilia.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:06.210
Those monsters are somehow
connected to the death of my children.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.460
You picked that thing up before the Guild got to it?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:16.790
Yes, as I told you at the Banquet for the Gods.
I had other plans to attend to that day.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.750
The rest you already know.

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:25.710
Still, I never thought anyone would pick up
our scent in the sewer we'd been investigating.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:29.000
Your story makes sense.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:32.000
But there's one thing I still don't get.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:37.080
How'd you know there'd be some kinda incident
at Monsterphilia in the first place?

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:44.500
Because I knew Monsterphilia
would be the perfect cover for the murderer.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:49.630
Thanks to the festivities, they could bring
monsters up to the surface openly.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.540
Hold on, you're sayin' GANESHA was behind this?!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.130
That child-lovin' sap would never...

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:58.000
No, Loki.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.920
You're proceeding from a false premise.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:04.670
Tell me, who was it that began the
Monsterphilia festivities in the first place?

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.170
You don't mean...

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:09.290
Uranus, do you?

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:15.790
The one who took the lives of my children and
unleashed those savage monsters upon the surface...

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.580
is likely...

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.670
Where'd the other one go?

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:41.830
Miss Ais! We finally caught her!

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:51.290
Maybe we should leave the interrogations
to the Boss rather than ourselves.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:53.750
Agreed. Let's return to the square.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:57.710
No! No, please! Don't!

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:01.540
If I go back there, it'll be me who... who...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.330
My name is Lulune.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.630
Lulune Louie, Hermes Familia.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.420
Why did you run away?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.500
I thought someone would kill me...

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.250
Kill you?

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:24.330
By any chance... do you have his possessions?

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:28.000
Do those really belong to Hashana,
the man who was murdered?

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.290
Yes...

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.330
Where did you get them?

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.790
I got a Quest.

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:38.000
All I had to do was go to a tavern and pick up a package.

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:49.290
And the person who gave it to you was Hashana.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:54.670
Yes. So when I heard that a man in full plate armor
had been killed, I was so scared...

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.630
Who was the client that hired you?

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.420
I don't know...

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:04.750
It's the truth! I was just walking down
the street the other night,

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:07.210
and this weird person in a robe
appeared outta nowhere.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:13.000
I thought it seemed a little fishy, but, you see,
the reward was so good that I...

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:16.710
I wish I'd never accepted that request.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:20.250
If that man was really murdered
because of this package...

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:23.630
Then, we can take it for you.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.330
What?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:29.830
All right.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.960
We can take a look, right?

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:36.750
Yes.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:40.080
I was told not to show it to anybody, but...

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:48.750
This feeling...

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:55.580
What is this...?

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:56.540
Miss Ais!
What is this...?

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:56.830
What is this...?

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.330
Are you all right, Miss Ais?

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.250
I'm fine...

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.500
Think that thing's dangerous after all?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.710
